<!--
  Six pages, three language pairs, listed pair after pair so the structure is
  readable here as well as in the tree. Every <url> carries the SAME three
  alternates as the <head> of the page it names — en, el, x-default — because
  an hreflang set has to be declared reciprocally or it is ignored.

  There is no <lastmod>, on purpose. A date here has to be true to be worth
  anything, and nothing in this repo updates one automatically; a stale
  <lastmod> is treated as noise and discounted, which is worse than none at
  all. Add them only alongside something that keeps them honest.

  404.html is absent for the obvious reason, and carries <meta name="robots"
  content="noindex"> of its own.
-->
